041", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75295893_1122035958805707_3976827415305179869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qgE6aItsHk0Q7kNvwH3iz5g&_nc_oc=Adrome7yqWWIjPSv-iNzUbwlRb5FQEI6XeBSGJoPBhz-RljzZRAFqCQp0fO6h3dKycg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEtMljwg5HqKZR8Gfcjmri71L_tfVYoJwg0cAO67vy8AA&oe=6A8D74C1"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO3.png", "id": "285314937333520", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035431_285314940666853_7917901485208087798_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j-19X1_5IdsQ7kNvwHR5Hmr&_nc_oc=AdoEhIWirnUz7IdtQl7tBNqaVBlZkAhR3yL2EwgAGNV5dm-WKglDQe9aB8ZFbnr4gg4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGLy_7Xkb2yMN_rw4liCP_3uBV8dxAkY3BoPmLSvJ75yg&oe=6A8D6626"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO5.png", "id": "381136241036217", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982584_381136244369550_483176816840528973_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sypWxXrnupwQ7kNvwEfhM66&_nc_oc=AdqOom6b4mLOVf5h2q9v5NgRkfMWNXPPCz3Pes7xovkliRGju1zTAMXGrZNMRBmwyl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFUPWPOOmRzKTHAM2Ekib1teTEJdQ5OWaqOMx9QMEsaWg&oe=6A8D76BA"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO6.png", "id": "2169394943393371", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2169394946726704_833013698734162480_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pXKIXjuiOfUQ7kNvwFfIZkN&_nc_oc=Adr2HaH3_meO1zW4bpuLfRaFL4PuMDneJhQwKf4r2YDHeSAItmFlU-wBYQfcdTlpFWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFFWzwuleYIdXFpMwFTgv4m2_4c8XnW6pV-6sHOC6B-zA&oe=6A8D788A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "1048298189708781", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003240_1048298193042114_5639017989450219791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TyoPh28hehIQ7kNvwEHu0NP&_nc_oc=AdqB1s2KX5gDKouGCaoDH1QtktWoq7DunRieyl8FCVijiHvzGACGBqWtuKz-zh8pQPg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE5BUr8262JPQPzmtyeZ9a3fTgVlp95uaThuz0TpGokxg&oe=6A8D73BD"}, "display_name": "VROO 360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VROO est une solution cl\u00e9-en-main pour pr\u00e9senter des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre public sur les appareils Meta Quest. Notre agence vous accompagne dans la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019un programme VR parfait pour votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement !\n> S\u00e9lectionnez vos films dans notre catalogue. VROO offre plus de 30 exp\u00e9riences (Fiction, Documentaire, Exp\u00e9rimental, Nature & D\u00e9couverte, Enfants, etc.) ;\n> Lancer l\u2019application et t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez vos films en utilisant un code PIN;\n> Profitez de votre application VROO personnalis\u00e9e : Une interface simple et ergonomique en mode kiosque qui permet \u00e0 vos spectateurs de d\u00e9marrer les films en utilisant leur regard.\n\nPour plus d\u2019informations, contactez notre \u00e9quipe :  hello@diversioncinema.com\n\n\nVROO is a simple solution to showcase 360\u00b0 movies to your audience on Meta Quest devices. Our agency helps you build the perfect VR program for your event!\n> Choose your movies from our catalog. VROO offers more than 30 experiences (Fiction, Documentary, Experimental, Nature & Discovery, Kids, etc.);\n> Launch the application and download your movies using a pin code;\n> Enjoy your personalized VROO app: A simple and ergonomic interface in kiosk mode that allows your spectators to play the movies using their gaze. \nFor more information, contact our team: hello@diversioncinema.com", "short_description": "Pr\u00e9sentez des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre publique en toute simplicit\u00e9 !\nThe easiest way to showcase 360 VR movies to your audience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroo.io/Legal-Notice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name"